> Watch your pet!  If they eat it, so can you.

Mostly.  There are one or two things that they will eat that
you're probably better off not eating.  And there are some
things that they will not eat, but that you should generally eat
(although perhaps not just at the start), at least once, for
useful side effects.

Two important things to remember: first, meat rots, and corpses
are meat---if you just killed it, fine, but otherwise, stay
clear; and second, if it killed you once (and was fresh), it
will do it again.  One of the most important things in this game
is understanding why you died, and not doing the same thing
again.

